Z||000033||LoW_KeY||12-31-2001||01:29 PM||||Man this just brings memorys of when people broke in mine and stole the cd player and a bunch of other stuff.<P>It's nearly not as bad as yours my car was still there with a pretty nice scratch in the door and I felt very pissed off!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Why can't anyone work for their own stuff, hope those bastards rot in hell! <P>I can say I feel your pain though.. I saw everything you had in that too.  Hopefully you return to the fiero and start where you left off.. <P>Did you have an alarm? just curious, but I feel a lot of what your sayin.. wasn't even my car but I can honestly feel some pain, such a shame  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>-KC<P>------------------<BR>AIM: FierFormula88   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/low_keysig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000034||Turbo88||12-31-2001||03:31 PM||||I had a stereo stolen once. But I think I had bitter sweet revenge. Everytime I buy a new peice of equipment, I take it apart and swap the positive and negitive inputs and use purple and green for the power and ground. It's doubtfull anyone will look at that when they break in. But when ever they try to hook it up, it will either GPF or fry! If I can't use it, I'll be damned if some other bastard will!!!<P>Sorry to hear your loss, good luck with the insurance. ||||reg||1
Z||000035||JetroGT||12-31-2001||07:16 PM||||Sorry about your loss man. I know people always break into cars but lately it seem to be getting more common. <BR>I will be going to radio shack to pick up a couple of toggle switches. One for the clutch switch and one for the fuel pump. My SE got broken into last month. Thank God my GT was in the shop! The only thing I had in it was my MP3 player. I breifly thought about leaving a "special" 100W Amp for them to steal, but I don't want to go to jail.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/NewSigt.jpg">   <BR>I work where all the missing paperclips go.||||reg||14
