Z||000038||Wade87GT||01-01-2002||02:13 AM||||Damn I'd be pissed. I've had my '87 GT for 12 years and 150,000 miles so it's definately a part of me. I was able to keep it as part of my divorce too. Even though I spent big dollars and a year of development on an RCC suspension, I love this car. What would it cost to replace it today, fun factor-wise? $40,000 for a C5, $30,000 for a 308 or practically nothing to keep mine (although the 4.9 plan is coming together piece by piece).||||reg||8
